  "question": {
    "text": "Let the area enclosed between the curves $|y|=1-x^2$ and $x^2+y^2=1$ be $\\alpha$. If $9 \\alpha=\\beta \\pi+\\gamma ; \\beta, \\gamma$ are integers, then the value of $|\\beta-\\gamma|$ equals.",
