  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/v1aMbTlvzmK2iqpp-k7ldBFHMIyosyetWO-gYe-AkgQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Required area }=\\pi-4 \\int_0^1\\left(1-x^2\\right) d x \\\\ & =\\pi-4\\left[x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^1 \\\\ & =\\pi-4 \\times \\frac{2}{3}=\\pi-\\frac{8}{3} \\\\ & \\therefore \\alpha=\\pi-\\frac{8}{3} \\\\ & 9 \\alpha=9 \\pi-24 \\rightarrow \\beta=9, \\gamma=-24 \\\\ & |\\beta-\\gamma|=|9+24|=33\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
